    {
      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-gothru-dashboard-4271",
      "display_title": "Issue #4271: Conditional Access for Professional Services Page based on Photographer Role",
      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Description</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Restrict visibility and access to the <strong>Professional Services</strong> page (<code class=\"notranslate\">/photographer/services</code>) and its navigation elements based on the photographer's role. Only photographers with the <code class=\"notranslate\">image_processing</code> role should have access to this page.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Requirements</h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">1. Sidebar Navigation</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Show the \"Professional Services\" menu item in <code class=\"notranslate\">PhotographerMenu</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">PhotographerNoviceMenu</code> <strong>only</strong> if the photographer's role is <code class=\"notranslate\">image_processing</code>.</li>\n<li>Hide this item for all other roles (e.g., <code class=\"notranslate\">photographer_360</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">image_editor</code>, etc.).</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">2. Route Guard &amp; Redirection</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>If a user navigates to <code class=\"notranslate\">/photographer/services</code> directly without the <code class=\"notranslate\">image_processing</code> role:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Redirect to <code class=\"notranslate\">/photographer/profile</code> if the profile status is approved (<code class=\"notranslate\">status === 3</code>).</li>\n<li>Redirect to <code class=\"notranslate\">/photographer/submission</code> for novice / unapproved status.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Avoid calling the professional services API if the role is unauthorized.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">3. Wizard Step Flow</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>In <code class=\"notranslate\">/photographer/tools</code> (Gear &amp; Tools step), clicking <strong>Next</strong>:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Route to <code class=\"notranslate\">/photographer/services</code> if the role is <code class=\"notranslate\">image_processing</code>.</li>\n<li>Skip directly to <code class=\"notranslate\">/photographer/submission</code> for all other roles.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">4. Page Reload State</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Ensure photographer profile and supporting data are properly initialized on reload so the sidebar does not get stuck in a loading skeleton state.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Demo by Developer</h2>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">Screen.Recording.2026-09-14.133005.mp4</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"videos/video-1ad803c9-7dcd-4ee4-9912-5ecd72dfcf07.mp4\" data-canonical-src=\"videos/video-1ad803c9-7dcd-4ee4-9912-5ecd72dfcf07.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n",
